        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium borates, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium borates, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of sodium borates. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
UUID: 47eb7b72-22ce-3395-8f35-37fd95dcf06e
Raw materials, machineries and energy consumption for production, estimated emissions to air from production and infrastructure of the site (approximation). No water emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data approximated with data from iron mining as well as lime crushing and milling. Land-use data based on conditions for sodium borates mining in California (USA).
Time period: date of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_47eb7b72-22ce-3395-8f35-37fd95dcf06e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
